  "description": "For as long as Han Young-Hae can remember, his neighbor, Yim Tae-Hwan, has always taken good care of him. But when Young-Hae starts having wild dreams about his hunky father-figure, he grows conflicted over his feelings. On the other hand, Tae-Hwan is plagued by prostate issues and buys a bunch of toys, thinking they'll help him. When Young-Hae walks in on Tae-Hwan using those toys, it's just like a scene from one of his dreams and he pounces! Will Young-Hae and Tae-Hwan be able to figure out their messy future together?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
